 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>(空间 S) 令 $S$ 为一切实 (或复) 数列 $$x=(\xi_1,\xi_2,\cdots,\xi_n,\cdots)$$ 组成的集合, 在 $S$ 中定义距离为
$$\rho(x,y)=\sum\limits_{k=1}^\infty \frac{1}{2^k}\cdot\frac{|\xi_k-\eta_k|}{1+|\xi_k-\eta_k|},$$
其中 $x=(\xi_1,\xi_2,\cdots,\xi_k,\cdots),y=(\eta_1,\eta_2,\cdots,\eta_k,\cdots)$. 求证 $S$ 为一个完备的度量空间.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>泛函分析作业250915</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/250915/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A/250915/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%B3%9B%E5%87%BD%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/">泛函分析</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="112">&lt;span>1.1.2&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#112" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>(Newton 法) 设 $f$ 是定义在 $[a,b]$ 上的二次连续可微的实值函数, $\hat{x}\in(a,b)$ 使得 $f(\hat x)=0, f&amp;rsquo;(\hat x)\neq 0$. 求证: 存在 $\hat x$ 的邻域 $U(\hat x)$, 使得 $\forall x_0\in U(\hat x)$, 迭代序列
$$x_{n+1}=x_n-\frac{f(x_n)}{f&amp;rsquo;(x_n)}\quad (n=0,1,2,\ldots)$$
是收敛的, 并且
$$\lim\limits_{n\to\infty}x_n=\hat x.$$&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>2025 阶群的单性和可解性</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%8A%BD%E8%B1%A1%E4%BB%A3%E6%95%B0/2025%E9%98%B6%E7%BE%A4/</link><pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 20:27:36 +0000</pubDate><author>nan22inf@google.com (uuku)</author><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/math/%E6%8A%BD%E8%B1%A1%E4%BB%A3%E6%95%B0/2025%E9%98%B6%E7%BE%A4/</guid><category domain="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E6%8A%BD%E8%B1%A1%E4%BB%A3%E6%95%B0/">抽象代数</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="2025-阶群的单性和可解性">&lt;span>2025 阶群的单性和可解性&lt;/span>
